# 📚 Recursion & Backtracking (Part 6) - Classic Backtracking Problems

## 📌 Introduction

Backtracking is one of the most powerful problem-solving techniques used in coding interviews. It systematically explores all possible solutions by making choices, recursively exploring them, and undoing those choices when necessary.

This chapter covers the most important Backtracking problems frequently asked in technical interviews.

