# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Every Backtracking problem follows:

```
Choose

↓

Explore

↓

Undo
```

---

✅ Always restore the original state after recursive calls.

---

✅ Mark visited nodes before recursion.

---

✅ Unmark visited nodes after recursion.

---

✅ Backtracking usually explores every possible solution.

